WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.333
GREG HIRSCH: Hey there, hey!

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.702
-Hey, hey sir.
-Oh, hey! Hey, excuse me.

00:00:03.936 --> 00:00:05.571
Hey, my Sherpa, what's cooking?

00:00:05.671 --> 00:00:08.974
Yeah, just-- Just might have
just touched Bill Gates.

00:00:09.174 --> 00:00:11.010
Ooh, hey,
did you check out the acoustics

00:00:11.076 --> 00:00:12.712
on my room for my talk?

00:00:12.979 --> 00:00:14.881
And did you get me
on the culture hike?

00:00:15.081 --> 00:00:17.049
And what did I--
What did I get in my chalet?

00:00:17.116 --> 00:00:18.684
Did I get the nut
and fruit box,

00:00:18.751 --> 00:00:20.352
or the champagne
and paperweight?

00:00:20.452 --> 00:00:21.388
Nuts.

00:00:22.588 --> 00:00:23.322
Yeah.

00:00:23.556 --> 00:00:25.992
But, uh--
But the talk venue's great.

00:00:26.158 --> 00:00:27.894
Uh, it's the same one
as Roman and Ken.

00:00:28.027 --> 00:00:29.428
-Oh, okay.
-Yeah, and, um--

00:00:29.562 --> 00:00:31.497
And don't worry about the nuts,
I mean the cashews

00:00:31.564 --> 00:00:33.166
-are the size of boomerangs.
-(CHUCKLING) Okay.

00:00:33.299 --> 00:00:34.800
-So...
-Thanks, man, thanks.

00:00:34.867 --> 00:00:37.036
Oh, hey.
Nice vest, Wambsgans,

00:00:37.203 --> 00:00:39.138
-it's so puffy.
-Thank you, Roman.

00:00:39.271 --> 00:00:41.006
What's it stuffed with,
your hopes and dreams?

00:00:41.106 --> 00:00:43.876
Oh, wow, hiking boots,
they're pristine.

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:45.311
Oh, here we go.

00:00:46.579 --> 00:00:49.149
All right,
all rise for Pope Big Dick.

00:00:49.648 --> 00:00:50.716
Hello, Rhea.

00:00:50.849 --> 00:00:51.884
Mr. Roy.

00:00:52.284 --> 00:00:53.686
You know what I need.

00:00:53.953 --> 00:00:55.588
-Hey, hey there--
-LOGAN ROY: Hi.

00:00:55.788 --> 00:00:57.557
Yeah, uh, just to say,
I don't know how up-to-speed

00:00:57.657 --> 00:00:59.726
you are, with all the details,
but, um, just say that

00:00:59.826 --> 00:01:02.228
we're all lined up for
the ATN strategy announcement.

00:01:02.328 --> 00:01:04.631
Yeah, same shit,
different wrapper.

00:01:04.731 --> 00:01:05.531
(STUTTERING) We're not gonna--

00:01:05.731 --> 00:01:08.434
we're not gonna go
with that banner, but we--

00:01:08.567 --> 00:01:11.171
Yeah, we settled on,
"We're Listening."

00:01:11.471 --> 00:01:12.505
It tested great.

00:01:12.572 --> 00:01:13.673
It tested fine.

00:01:16.109 --> 00:01:17.343
Do me a favor.

00:01:17.944 --> 00:01:19.211
Is that Sandy Furness?

00:01:19.445 --> 00:01:21.047
-Uh...
-Oh, yes. Yes, yes.

00:01:21.113 --> 00:01:22.648
Keep talking, keep talking.

00:01:22.715 --> 00:01:23.516
HIRSCH: Oh, yeah.

00:01:23.716 --> 00:01:25.351
I don't want to bump him,
not here, not now.

00:01:25.418 --> 00:01:27.120
-TOM WAMBSGANS: Okay.
-The vipers would love it.

00:01:27.220 --> 00:01:29.221
HIRSCH: Well, gladly--
We'd be honored

00:01:29.321 --> 00:01:30.890
-to be your talking partners.
-WAMBSGANS: Yes.

00:01:31.023 --> 00:01:33.459
And so basically the talk
is a celebration

00:01:33.592 --> 00:01:35.861
of putting audience input
front-and-center,

00:01:36.028 --> 00:01:37.463
and hopefully
be really inclusive

00:01:37.563 --> 00:01:39.365
and quite change-y
after recent events.

00:01:39.832 --> 00:01:43.236
Because ATN Citizen
is essentially very similar,

00:01:43.336 --> 00:01:45.004
but with the option
of new--

00:01:45.104 --> 00:01:48.007
How's he-- How's he looking?
Is he healthy?

00:01:48.274 --> 00:01:51.210
-Uh... not really.
-Uh, he looks...

00:01:51.310 --> 00:01:54.113
-he looks a little enfeebled.
-Yeah, yeah.

00:01:54.447 --> 00:01:57.717
I heard-- I heard maybe...

00:01:58.785 --> 00:01:59.919
maybe syphilis.

00:02:00.286 --> 00:02:01.854
-Whoa.
-What? Really?

00:02:02.121 --> 00:02:03.255
-And that's deadly.
-Interesting.

00:02:03.556 --> 00:02:06.892
'Cause you don't really hear
much about syphilis these days.

00:02:07.359 --> 00:02:10.563
Very much the, uh--
the MySpace of STDs.

